| Accent colour | Confirm from Figma/CSS | Links, buttons, and highlights |
| Border colour | Confirm from Figma/CSS | Card and input borders |

#### Contrast Ratios

Contrast ratios should be measured using the final colour combinations.

| Combination | Contrast ratio | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Body text and main background | To be measured | To be tested |
| Secondary text and background | To be measured | To be tested |
| Accent text and background | To be measured | To be tested |
| Button text and button background | To be measured | To be tested |

The target for normal body text is a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1, as specified in the assignment brief.

